            <title>[LU-20427] sanity-lnet.sh sets invalid subsystem_debug values</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20427</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20329" title="debug fixes and improvements" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20329"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-20329&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; patch &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/66451" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/66451&lt;/a&gt; dropped "neterror net nettrace malloc" arguments from set_default_debug and moved them to SUBSYSTEM environment variable at the top of sanity-lnet.sh, but SUBSYSTEM is the variable used to set subsystem_debug mask, not the debug mask. The correct variable is PTLDEBUG.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
